      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "3. For the purpose of notice to the informant and information of victim-child in terms of the above Act and Rules, let the copy of the appeal memo and Interlocutory Application received by the learned counsel for the State be sent to the informant and victim by Mr. A.K. Apat, learned Addl. PP through concerned Police Station indicating therein the probable date of hearing.\n4. Pending admission of the appeal, the digitized copy of the LCR be called for from the learned trial Court.",
